{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016800/extras/aaabce868b33184fc411c72dbb22284c.avif?t=1759182759\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO DESCRIPTION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a <strong>Community Leader</strong> in this demo of <i>P\u00e4l\u0259tiks</i>.<br>The demo features a <strong>20-day campaign</strong>, where you\u2019ll rally blocs like Youth, Seniors, Business Owners, and more. With campaign buttons and party members at your disposal, every decision matters as you balance outreach, sabotage, and resource management to win local support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to turn a small neighborhood campaign into the first step of a political empire?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016800?t=1759182759","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016800/7803c63fe1a149fd0577b4e8948dabf281b13336/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759182759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016800/93ae60ad21bd37c974d0a2e9c2e4129552a17500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759182759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016800/93ae60ad21bd37c974d0a2e9c2e4129552a17500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759182759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 